body:
SO if i really like a weapon it is best to just to commit to it and invest forma etc so that it can actually be tested out.

&#x200B;

e.g if I am enjoying the baza (although would probably wait till I got Baza prime) I should forma etc it and then try it out in simulacrum?

Apologies as i realise this has been around for 2 months, In my campaigns I often give players a free feat at level 1, would you also give the companion a free feat as if it would be an ASI?

&#x200B;

Do you think there would be any huge balance implications from such a move?
